 of $2.4 million, legal-related expenses of $2.3 million and a small restructuring and acquisition-related benefit.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2021/10/28/bio-rad-laboratories-inc-bio-q3-2021-earnings-call/"},{"c":"BIO 2025 Q4","e":"bio","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jonathan DiVincenzo","x":"Throughout 2025, we made tangible progress in lowering our cost base through restructuring and tighter expense discipline while navigating global trade uncertainty and tariff headwinds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/bio-rad-bio-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2025 Q4","e":"bio","d":"2026-02-12","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Norman Schwartz","x":"The team, I think, successfully mitigated much of the impact on our supply chain from what we saw as shifting trade policies and tariffs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/bio-rad-bio-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2025 Q4","e":"bio","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"Note that the Q4 2025 non-GAAP gross margin excluded $13 million in onetime inventory and other write-offs associated with product portfolio rationalization on top of restructuring and amortization of purchased intangible charges.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/bio-rad-bio-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2025 Q4","e":"bio","d":"2026-02-12","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"Our 2025 restructuring was effectively completed, and the savings are reflected in our 2026 outlook.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/02/12/bio-rad-bio-q4-2025-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q1","e":"bio","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Jonathan DiVincenzo","x":"During the quarter, we began manufacture of select life science instruments in China for China, improving responsiveness to local market demand and allowing us to feed in tenders while minimizing tariff exposure.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/bio-rad-bio-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q1","e":"bio","d":"2026-04-30","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"Part of what we're evaluating is just overall, considering the continued challenges that seem to be arising, whether that's tariffs last year and now Middle East conflict, which arguably can't be predicted to this magnitude.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/bio-rad-bio-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q1","e":"bio","d":"2026-04-30","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"The increase in SG&A expense was primarily due to foreign exchange impacting -- impact resulting from a weaker U.S. dollar on our international cost base, partially offset by lower restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/05/01/bio-rad-bio-q1-2026-earnings-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q2","e":"bio","d":"2026-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"So from a tariff standpoint, we've obviously applied for refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/bio-rad-bio-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q2","e":"bio","d":"2026-08-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"I think as that gets settled out, we will then have some conclusion on it from a tariff standpoint and hope to be able to see some tariffs running through the P&L at that time.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/bio-rad-bio-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q2","e":"bio","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Jonathan DiVincenzo","x":"Cost savings are one outcome, but this is not simply a cost reduction program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/bio-rad-bio-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q2","e":"bio","d":"2026-08-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"The restructure within the functional OpEx areas involves headcount reductions, facility rationalization and adding critical skills in support of growth and innovation.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/08/11/bio-rad-bio-q2-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q3","e":"bio","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"Our third quarter results do not include any benefit from tariff refunds.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/bio-rad-bio-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q3","e":"bio","d":"2026-11-04","l":"tariffs","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"In our year-end results, we expect to recognize any tariff refunds that we receive.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/bio-rad-bio-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q3","e":"bio","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"The year-over-year decline primarily reflects charges associated with our restructuring program.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/bio-rad-bio-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q3","e":"bio","d":"2026-11-04","l":"cost_cuts","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"The increase in SG&A expense was primarily due to higher restructuring costs.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/bio-rad-bio-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"},{"c":"BIO 2026 Q3","e":"bio","d":"2026-11-04","l":"guidance","r":"management","s":"Roop Lakkaraju","x":"We are reaffirming our guidance of full year '26 currency-neutral revenue growth between minus 3% and plus 0.5%.","url":"https://www.fool.com/earnings/call-transcripts/2026/11/05/bio-rad-bio-q3-2026-earnings-call-transcript/"}],"trends":{"theater":[[35,1,5311,0,0,0,4100